        "procurement_stage": "Preliminary Market Engagement",
        "engagement": "Digital Health Care Wales (DHCW) intends to conduct market engagement with providers who may interested in bidding for the GP Managed Print Service Contract. DHCW has not defined a 'route to market' and therefore DHCW welcomes engagement from potential providers. The intention is for DHCW to conduct a market engagement presentation session, with providers who have noted an interest in this Preliminary Market Engagement Notice, in mid June via a digital platform. This session will include an overview the requirements and initial thoughts on an evaluation methodology. Furthermore, individual sessions may be made available for the purpose of question and answer sessions, between providers and DHCW, in the days following the engagement session.",
